readme.text:
1. 点击输入框左下 🎤 开始录音(再点结束,最长 60s);
2. 等待「♪ SenseVoice 正在识别…」,文本自动写入输入框;
3. 悬浮按钮可看模型就绪状态;失败显示具体原因,再点重试。

- 离线批处理,无流式;单段 ≤ 60s;
- 首次识别需等待模型加载;
- 仅服务 127.0.0.1 桌面进程(桌面自带访问控制)。

1. Click the 🎤 at the bottom-left of the composer to record (click again to stop, 60s max);
2. Wait for “♪ SenseVoice 正在识别…”, the text lands in the input box;
3. Hover the button for model readiness; failures show the concrete reason — click to retry.

- Batch (non-streaming) recognition; keep clips ≤ 60s;
- The first recognition waits for model loading;
- Routes serve the loopback desktop process only.
